                                                "sense_id": "c45c5369-71ad-3851-9d00-65766d1e2fb0",
                                                "text": "For several days he went about his charge with disgust, trying everything he could to avoid the stench of rotting vegetation and of human feces, which was overpowering even as it all burned under the plasma from his beamer."
                                            }
