                                                "sense_id": "fc0d26a2-ba2e-316a-8019-46a6f7fc3158",
                                                "text": "Get your pre-smile working, move toward him, shake hands, glue eyes […] and then launch your beamer, a big, toothy (uppers and lowers showing) grin."
